{"type":"message","id":"fb6f761b","parentId":"a037ed73","timestamp":"2026-03-04T05:26:13.798Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 13:26 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: 修复 CGNS Mesh Cutter 的链接问题\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n项目运行时段错误，根因是符号冲突：\n- `CGFile` 使用原生 CGNS API\n- 但项目链接了 `libcgio.so`\n- 符号冲突导致 `CGIO::Zone::number_node()` 被错误调用\n\n## 问题定位\n1. `src/CMakeLists.txt` 第68行: `target_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC compi cgio)`\n2. `src/cgFile.cpp` 第8行: `#include <cgns_io.h>`\n3. `src/metisCutter.cpp` 第9行: `#include <cgns_io.h>`\n\n## Requirements\n1. **移除 cgio 链接** - 修改 `src/CMakeLists.txt`，删除 `cgio` 链接\n2. **移除 cgns_io.h include** - 从 `cgFile.cpp` 和 `metisCutter.cpp` 中删除 `#include <cgns_io.h>`\n3. **编译验证** - 确保 cmake 重新配置并编译成功\n4. **不要修改任何其他代码** - 只做上述最小改动\n\n## 环境设置\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nsource ../env.sh\nexport PATH=$MPI_ROOT/bin:$PATH\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$CGNS_ROOT/lib:$METIS_ROOT/lib:$PARMETIS_ROOT/lib:$MPI_ROOT/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n```\n\n## Deliverable\n1. 修改后的文件列表\n2. 编译成功输出\n3. 如果编译失败，报告具体错误\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772601973795}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b696eeb","parentId":"fb6f761b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T05:26:21.860Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to fix a linking issue in CGNS Mesh Cutter project\n2. The problem is symbol conflict - CGFile uses native CGNS API but the project links to libcgio.so\n3. I need to:\n   - Remove `cgio` from `target_link_libraries` in `src/CMakeLists.txt` line 68\n   - Remove `#include <cgns_io.h>` from `src/cgFile.cpp` line 8\n   - Remove `#include <cgns_io.h>` from `src/metisCutter.cpp` line 9\n   - Verify compilation works\n   - Do NOT modify anything else\n\nLet me start by reading the files to confirm the exact content that needs to be changed.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll fix the CGNS Mesh Cutter linking issue by making the minimal required changes. Let me start by examining the files that need modification."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-73f95b0136474fc5953d896b2bc1e408","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/CMakeLists.txt"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-33bca985355847d2aa2fda938abc9a09","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/cgFile.cpp","limit":20}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-cbc878ce32e048f5ba0539a79ba56e3f","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp","limit":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":6441,"output":435,"cacheRead":6141,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13017,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772601973797}}
{"type":"message","id":"e8b2f391","parentId":"9b696eeb","timestamp":"2026-03-04T05:26:21.865Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-73f95b0136474fc5953d896b2bc1e408","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#\n# A small macro used for converting a list into a space\n# separated string:\n#\nMACRO(TO_STRING _variable)\n  SET(${_variable} \"\")\n  FOREACH(_var  ${ARGN})\n    SET(${_variable} \"${${_variable}} ${_var}\")\n  ENDFOREACH()\n  STRING(STRIP \"${${_variable}}\" ${_variable})\nENDMACRO()\n\n#\n# If 'variable' is empty it will be set to 'value'\n#\nMACRO(SET_IF_EMPTY _variable)\n  IF(\"${${_variable}}\" STREQUAL \"\")\n    SET(${_variable} ${ARGN})\n  ENDIF()\nENDMACRO()\n\n\nMACRO(_FIND_LIBRARY _library_name)\n  TO_STRING(_str ${ARGN})\n  FIND_LIBRARY(${_library_name} ${ARGN})\n  IF(${_library_name} MATCHES \"-NOTFOUND\")\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"${_library_name} not found! The call was:\")\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"    FIND_LIBRARY(${_library_name} ${_str})\")\n  ELSE()\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"Found ${${_library_name}}\")\n    target_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC ${${_library_name}})\n  ENDIF()\nENDMACRO()\n\nMACRO(_FIND_PATH _path_name)\n  TO_STRING(_str ${ARGN})\n  FIND_PATH(${_path_name} ${ARGN})\n  IF(${_path_name} MATCHES \"-NOTFOUND\")\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"${_path_name} not found! The call was:\")\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"    FIND_PATH(${_path_name} ${_str})\")\n  ELSE()\n    MESSAGE(STATUS \"Found ${${_path_name}}\")\n    target_include_directories(${TgtLib} PUBLIC ${${_path_name}})\n  ENDIF()\nENDMACRO()\n\n# CGNS\nSET_IF_EMPTY(CGNS_DIR \"$ENV{CGNS_ROOT}\")\n_FIND_LIBRARY(CGNS_LIBRARY\n    NAMES cgns\n    HINTS ${CGNS_DIR}\n    PATH_SUFFIXES lib64 lib\n)\n_FIND_PATH(CGNS_INCLUDE_DIR cgnslib.h\n    HINTS ${CGNS_DIR}\n    PATH_SUFFIXES include cgns include/cgns\n)\n\n# METIS\nset (METIS_ROOT \"$ENV{METIS_ROOT}\")\nfind_library(metislib NAMES metis PATHS \"${METIS_ROOT}/lib\" NO_DEFAULT_PATH)\nif(metislib)\n    message(STATUS \"Found metis: \" ${metislib})\n    target_compile_definitions(${TgtLib} PUBLIC \"SUPPORT_METIS\")\n    target_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC ${metislib})\n    target_include_directories(${TgtLib} PUBLIC \"${METIS_ROOT}/include\")\nelseif()\n    message(ERROR \"Can not find metis.\")\nendif()\n\n# ParMETIS\nset (PARMETIS_ROOT \"$ENV{PARMETIS_ROOT}\")\nfind_library(parmetislib NAMES parmetis PATHS \"${PARMETIS_ROOT}/lib\" REQUIRED NO_DEFAULT_PATH)\nif(parmetislib)\n    target_compile_definitions(${TgtLib} PUBLIC \"SUPPORT_PARMETIS\")\n    message(STATUS \"Found parmetis: \" ${parmetislib})\n    target_include_directories(${TgtLib} PUBLIC \"${PARMETIS_ROOT}/include\")\n    target_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC ${parmetislib})\nelseif()\n    message(ERROR \"Can not find parmetis.\")\nendif()\n\n# Link external libraries\ntarget_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC compi cgio)\n\ntarget_include_directories(${TgtLib} \nPUBLIC \n    ${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR}\n)\n\ntarget_sources(${TgtLib}\nPRIVATE\n    meshCutter.cpp\n    stringUtil.cpp\n    cmdLine.cpp\n    cgFile.cpp\n    cartesianCutter.cpp\n    metisCutter.cpp\n    mpiAdapter.cpp\n)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772601981863}}
